      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're grappling with a feeling of cosmic insignificance, which is a very profound and difficult thought. Many people wrestle with the vastness of the universe and how it relates to our small lives. While the universe is incredibly large, your personal experiences, emotions, and connections hold immense meaning to *you*. Focusing on small, tangible joys or helping someone else can sometimes ground us when the bigger picture feels overwhelming.",
